// Title: Operator Bloopers Cobalt Strike Modules
// ID: 4f154fb6-27d1-4813-a759-78b93e0b9c48
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: _pete_0, TheDFIRReport
// Date: 2022-05-06
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.003
// Description: Detects Cobalt Strike module/commands accidentally entered in CMD shell
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_Invoke-UserHunter*" or process.command_line like "*_Invoke-ShareFinder*" or process.command_line like "*_Invoke-Kerberoast*" or process.command_line like "*_Invoke-SMBAutoBrute*" or process.command_line like "*_Invoke-Nightmare*" or process.command_line like "*_zerologon*" or process.command_line like "*_av_query*")) and ((process.pe.original_file_name == "Cmd.Exe") or (process.executable endswith "\\cmd.exe")))
